Third-party content NOT covered by this license
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Bible texts
  The application only ships Bible translations that are in the public
  domain. They are not covered by the AGPL and remain free for anyone to use:

  - Louis Segond 1910 (French) - public domain.
  - King James Version (English) - public domain, except in the United
    Kingdom where it is subject to Crown rights.

  Source files come from eBible.org (https://ebible.org) and are converted
  by the project's import script. Exact sources are listed in
  packages/bible-data once added. Copyrighted modern translations are never
  included; the application only links to external readers (e.g. YouVersion)
  for them.

